{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7468","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:48.523058+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"JAX now initializes all available platforms eagerly, including GPU if present. `jax_platform_name` determines which platform is preferred by default.\r\n\r\nSo this is working as intended, but you've identified one very good workaround if it's a problem (set `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES` to the empty string).\r\n\r\nIf this is a problem we could possibly revive some sort of flag to remove certain platforms from the set we initialize.","created_at":"2021-08-03T12:28:07Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/7468#issuecomment-891806783","id":891806783,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7468","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc41J-Q_","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/891806783/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-08-03T12:28:07Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/891806783","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Thanks for the quick reply @hawkinsp. The workaround is fine for me. \r\n\r\nFyi, the only difference is this printout\r\n\r\n```\r\n2021-08-03 14:30:05.074166: E external/org_tensorflow/tensorflow/stream_executor/cuda/cuda_driver.cc:271] failed call to cuInit: CUDA_ERROR_NO_DEVICE: no CUDA-capable device\r\nis detected\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhich previously was suppressed when setting `jax_platform_name = \"cpu\"` .","created_at":"2021-08-03T12:36:21Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/7468#issuecomment-891811976","id":891811976,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7468","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc41J_iI","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/891811976/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-08-03T12:36:21Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/891811976","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5190547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clemisch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clemisch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clemisch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clemisch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clemisch","id":5190547,"login":"clemisch","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTA1NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clemisch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clemisch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clemisch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clemisch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clemisch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clemisch","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Dear jax team,\r\n\r\nI've noticed that jax uses a small amount (137 MiB) of GPU memory, even when the platform is set to `cpu`. \r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport jax\r\njax.config.update(\"jax_platform_name\", \"cpu\")\r\n\r\njax.numpy.zeros(100_000) + 1   # uses 137 MiB on every GPU, independent of array size\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis led to crashes on a server where the GPUs are completely full (not best practice, I know), even though no computation is performed on the GPU. \r\n\r\nIs this intended behavior? Is `jax_platform_name` deprecated?\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA workaround is setting `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES` to an empty string:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport os\r\nos.environ[\"CUDA_DEVICE_ORDER\"] = \"PCI_BUS_ID\"\r\nos.environ[\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\"] = \"\"\r\n\r\njax.numpy.zeros(100_000) + 1    # does not use GPU memory\r\n```\r\n\r\n","closed_at":"2021-08-03T23:47:56Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/328992?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqiaorjc","id":328992,"login":"zhangqiaorjc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODk5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqiaorjc/subscriptions","t